#. module: rfid_service_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:rfid_service_base.field_rfid_service__mail_template_id
msgid ""
"Email template used when sending badges/cards to customers.\n"
"        \n"
"• Purpose: Customize the email content and appearance sent to customers\n"
"• Content: Can include card details, access instructions, and company branding\n"
